      <h2>Need help choosing?</h2>
      <p style="max-width:560px;margin:16px auto 24px">Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@auraandoak.com">hello@auraandoak.com</a> with a little about the person you're shopping for. We'll put together a recommendation.</p>
